      "2.6.30 repairs Lua-split dependency ownership/initialization order after Yellow runtime Forgiveness failures; gameplay rules, saves, and public APIs are unchanged.",
      "2.6.28 expands No Status Moves with Poison/Toxic and Freeze, and adds scoped Flinch/Trap clauses while preserving damaging hits; exact-edition runtime confirmation is required.",
      "2.6.27 audits shared Gold/Silver Setup/NUZ RULES wording and adds Silver-focused exact-edition parity diagnostics; gameplay rules, saves, and public compatibility APIs are unchanged.",
      "2.6.26 canonicalizes current internal Gen 2 ownership names while retaining historical aliases, and adds exact Gold/Silver identity fields to shared-adapter diagnostics; gameplay rules and public APIs are unchanged.",
      "2.6.25 extends PKMN BAN to Gold/Silver with the full 251-species National Dex and cleans current shared Gen 2 wording/identity; exact Gold and Silver runtime confirmation remains required.",
      "2.6.24 adds scoped status/setup battle restrictions plus the first R/B/Y 151-species PKMN BAN picker; these gameplay/UI additions are static-tested and require exact-edition runtime confirmation.",
      "2.6.23 adds a native config-list position strip to NUZ RULES and Setup: current/total is always visible, with native up/down indicators only when rows are offscreen above/below; gameplay, saves, rules, and APIs are unchanged.",
      "2.6.22 adds DEFAULT / N CHANGED summaries to collapsed NUZ RULES and Setup section headers on both classic R/B/Y and native Gen 2 presenters; gameplay, saves, rules, and APIs are unchanged.",
      "2.6.21 keeps 00000000 as true AUTO: each NEW GAME resolves a fresh playthrough seed without rewriting Setup, while nonzero seeds remain fixed/replayable; Setup also adds Reroll Seed for a new fixed seed.",
      "2.6.20 stamps Save Schema 4 on fresh save.created lifecycles and clears stale save-scoped safe-stop state before NEW GAME writes into its new namespace; public APIs and rule behavior are unchanged.",
      "2.6.17 extracts classic UI/tracker presentation, competitive battle-clause wiring, and late-runtime Gold/Silver/compatibility adapters into dedicated modules; gameplay intent, saves, rules, and API versions are unchanged.",
      "2.6.16 expands NUZ RULES N/A/redundancy/interaction/locked guidance across the rule catalog without changing enforcement, saves, rule defaults, or API versions.",
      "2.6.15 adds optional Sleep/OHKO/Evasion Clauses, section-scoped NUZ RULES reset/help improvements, and stronger read-only diagnostics; exact Gen 1 and Gen 2 clause runtime confirmation is still required.",
      "2.6.11 hardens ENC TRACKER projection and rendering so malformed legacy/provider rows fail safely instead of terminating the process.",
      "2.6.9 clarifies CUSTOM loadouts and preset transitions, adds current-cap/API metadata to status diagnostics, and strengthens provider/API Release Safety checks.",
      "2.6.8 adds an optional Instant Text QOL toggle while preserving native dialogue prompts, page transitions, scrolling, sounds, choices, and scripted waits.",
      "2.6.2 condenses historical public release text and adds a shipped-document hygiene audit; gameplay/API versions are unchanged.",
      "2.6.1 adds Compatibility API contract assertions, non-destructive stored-rule validation, and pure-helper property audits without changing gameplay/API versions.",
      "2.6.0 promotes the runtime-booted 2.5.92 line to release and moves PC Catches to the first QOL row without changing its rule/save/enforcement semantics.",
