      "Gen1Recomp 0.2.19 is the latest source-audited release. Its 17-commit delta preserves the protected Gold Bill's PC withdrawal/space/release seams, adds an improved Gen 2 EXP announce seam not currently owned by Nuzlocke, and requires no Mod API, Save Schema, or engine-range change.",
